---

At night, leyline pillars may appear in the distance. Find them. Charge them. Open a **Leyline Rift**.

A rift is a wave-based encounter. Clear the waves, collapse the rift, and claim rewards: theme loot, experience, and a chance at the rare **Ley Crystal**.

Every fully charged pillar can tear open a different kind of rift — from amethyst surges to void tears and chaotic echoes. Treat the night loop as the school’s world content, not just a spell list.
